 his skills - what few he has - as the man with yesterday’s analogue methods faces off against tomorrow’s digital technology.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":474395,\"title\":\"Teen Titans Go! To the Movies\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mFHihhE9hlvJEk2f1AqdLRaYHd6.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6FTc6G8gwawItBqGQd7sYtf6s3f.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"All the major DC superheroes are starring in their own films, all but the Teen Titans, so Robin is determined to remedy this situation by getting over his role as a sidekick and becoming a movie star. Thus, with a few madcap ideas and an inspirational song in their hearts, the Teen Titans head to Hollywood to fulfill their dreams.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Action\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":11199,\"title\":\"Wild Hogs\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qYyPCZcpNGZwbyBo1gwdCiW5hHC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/es74vwJqbT6cwMdJmTeSIcjJjoo.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Restless and ready for an adventure, four suburban bikers leave the safety of their subdivision and head out on the open road. But complications ensue when they cross paths with an intimidating band of New Mexico bikers known as the Del Fuegos.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":14560,\"title\":\"Paul Blart: Mall Cop\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/A4zZv0Q1VKURFZFEl2vwjaE2q0g.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nZwlezCansLTXU6w775zj9RAm4u.jpg\",\"rating\":5.4,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When a shopping mall is taken over by a gang of organized crooks, it's up to a mild-mannered security guard to save the day.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":10610,\"title\":\"The Medallion\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lbjFWKfe8WdS8Pj6WVPlyEKeVEo.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/533o6HpRqtdCCOiCitICyUSFJCj.jpg\",\"rating\":5.7,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A Hong Kong detective suffers a fatal accident involving a mysterious medallion and is transformed into an immortal warrior with superhuman powers.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Fantasy\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":27601,\"title\":\"Citizen Toxie: The Toxic Avenger IV\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wR4VvqrRd2r9M4GYXPnoV02aUNG.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rydjFBcArIdctIRD9kgRcoIyH6U.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A horrific explosion creates a dimensional portal between Tromaville and its dimensional mirror image, Amortville. While the Toxie is trapped in the mirror dimension, Tromaville comes under the control of his evil doppelganger, the Noxious Offender.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":5146,\"title\":\"The In-Laws\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/15TNyg00AMSDff6u77AR9JeaEzR.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2cT8Q75gYiseEuPOE55n3lmBpRk.jpg\",\"rating\":5.6,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Right before his daughter's wedding, a mild-mannered foot doctor discovers that his new in-laws are international smugglers.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":17708,\"title\":\"Corky Romano\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aLgzSIgHTyWggrP7ieDVYE3PB8g.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3kOMMRwf9AEdQ2STIb4tjcsRx9w.jpg\",\"rating\":4.5,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Corky Romano is a bumbling, simpleton, veterinarian and the youngest, outcast son of an aging gangster, named Pops Romano, who calls upon Corky to infiltrate the local FBI and retrieve and destroy evidence being used to incriminate Pops for racketeering charges.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":19766,\"title\":\"Inspector Gadget 2\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6g5L4lpsQ1jYDJpMn1XGYOGzlar.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jeWcKqVdsQbVsyALogXQh6aH0A5.jpg\",\"rating\":4.2,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After capturing Claw, all the criminals have gone into hiding. Until Claw escapes! Gadget thinks he will get the case, but everyone else has other plans. A new version of the Gadget project is unveiled in the form of G2. Strict orders are given for Gadget to stay away from G2 and every crime scene, but Gadget feels he is needed more than anyone.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9256,\"title\":\"Kopps\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uKHXQGqnr1pVfKWv8vGPgWusWuE.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3Dj0PASsZymZ98X9m0iW39qCFaj.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A small Swedish village, Högboträsk, is so peaceful that crime is nonexistent. The police spend their shifts drinking coffee, eating hot dogs and chasing down runaway cows. This is all well and good for the village's own police, but the police management board wants to discontinue the local police force for lack of crime.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":10588,\"title\":\"The Cat in the Hat\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uYYLz67e5xEQMsY858VSSCDsLU6.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ihOd5W6qOgrBSLj0uDTnGs8k1aa.jpg\",\"rating\":5.4,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"During a rainy day, and while their mother is out, Conrad and Sally, and their pet fish, are visited by the mischievous Cat in the Hat. Fun soon turns to mayhem, and the siblings must figure out how to rid themselves of the maniacal Cat.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Adventure\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"